WEBVTT

00:00:00.112 --> 00:00:05.656
This video shows how a school admin or a principal manages users on a phone.

00:00:07.318 --> 00:00:17.518
Tap the menu button, choose Settings, then tap the Users tab. Every user of your school is a card, with a search box and a role filter at the top.

00:00:27.749 --> 00:00:34.733
Tap Add User. A form opens with the name, username, email, password and role.

00:00:40.029 --> 00:00:52.245
Type the first and last name, a username, an email, and the password twice. Then choose the role, here Teacher. The list only offers the roles you are allowed to create.

00:01:13.265 --> 00:01:20.465
Tap Create User. A green message says the user was created, and they can log in straight away.

00:01:27.680 --> 00:01:36.104
To find the person again, type part of the name in the search box. Their card shows the name, the email and the role.

00:01:39.433 --> 00:01:50.161
Tap Edit on the card to change the name, email, role or phone. Here we add a phone number and tap Update. The username cannot be changed.

00:02:05.515 --> 00:02:17.443
If someone forgets their password, tap Reset Password. Type a new password twice and tap Reset Password again. You can also choose to email them a reset link.

00:02:31.531 --> 00:02:38.083
Tap Deactivate and the card shows Inactive. That person can no longer log in.

00:02:45.351 --> 00:02:51.135
Tap Activate to give the access back. A green message confirms it.

00:03:02.479 --> 00:03:06.727
You only see these buttons for the roles you are allowed to manage.
